iral notebook, pencils, ruler, crushed student, and teacher recognizable in the background.\\n   - On mobile screens, smartly anchored so the notebook title and key illustration remain in focus.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🏗️ System Architecture & Workflow\\n\\n```mermaid\\nflowchart TD\\n    A[\\\"🚀 App Launch (index.html)\\\"] --> B[\\\"⏳ Animated Splash (2.5s)\\\"]\\n    B -->|Check localStorage Session| C{\\\"User Remembered?\\\"}\\n    C -->|No| D[\\\"🔐 Glassmorphic Login / Guest Mode\\\"]\\n    C -->|Yes| E[\\\"🏠 Home Survival Dashboard\\\"]\\n    D -->|Submit / Guest Click| E\\n    \\n    E --> F[\\\"📊 Attendance Engine (75% Math)\\\"]\\n    E --> G[\\\"📝 Assignment Countdown (Sorted Deadlines)\\\"]\\n    E --> H[\\\"🍔 Campus Canteen (Status & Price Calculator)\\\"]\\n    E --> I[\\\"📅 Weekly Timetable (Auto Current Day)\\\"]\\n    E --> J[\\\"⏳ Exam Countdown (Live Seconds Ticker)\\\"]\\n    E --> K[\\\"😂 S\n<truncated 2744 bytes>","Description":"\"Showcase artifact for the Student Survival App featuring the Life of a Student artwork, system flow, mathematical formulas, and launch instructions.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\DELL\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b1401ff7-7a8f-4c14-be76-c6f41632d249\\\\student_survival_app_showcase.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Create Student Survival App showcase artifact\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
