{"step_index":91,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T05:36:57Z","content":"Here is the completed, fully functional **Student Survival App 🎓🧑‍🎓🔥**!\n\nI have created a comprehensive showcase artifact for your project:\n👉 **[student_survival_app_showcase.md](file:///C:/Users/DELL/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b1401ff7-7a8f-4c14-be76-c6f41632d249/student_survival_app_showcase.md)**\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Where the Code Lives\n\n1. **Recommended Workspace**:  \n   📁 **`C:\\Users\\DELL\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\student-survival-app`**  \n   *(I recommend setting this directory as your active workspace in Antigravity).*\n\n2. **Desktop Directory**:  \n   📁 **`C:\\Users\\DELL\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\student survival\\student-survival-app`**\n\nTo run the application, double-click **[`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/DELL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/student-survival-app/index.html)** in any web browser. Zero build steps, terminal commands, or npm packages are needed.\n\n---\n\n### 🖼️ How the Uploaded Artwork Was Integrated\n\nThe uploaded notebook-style illustration **“Life of a Student”** (showing the smiling teacher sitting on Mid, Quiz, Project, Assignments, with the crushed student underneath) is used in two ways:\n\n1. **App Icon & Logo Badge**:\n   - Clean, rounded-square crop with glowing borders and glass badges on the **Loading Splash Screen**, the **Glassmorphism Login Card**, the **Top Sticky Navigation Header**, and the **Student Profile**.\n2. **Full-Screen Background**:\n   - Implemented as a responsive fixed background (`background-size: cover; background-position: center; background-attachment: fixed;`).\n   - Covered with a dark translucent glassmorphic overlay (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px)`), ensuring all text, badges, buttons, and progress bars maintain contrast while the artwork remains visible behind the UI.\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 Key Features Included\n\n- **⏳ Animated Loading Screen**: ~2.5 second splash screen with a dynamic progress bar and cycling humorous student quotes (*“📚 Finding your motivation... ERROR 404.”*, *“☕ Brewing academic survival mode...”*).\n- **🔐 Login / Welcome Screen**: Frosted glass card with Student Name, Email, Remember Me, Guest Mode, and personalized greetings (*“Welcome back! Your assignments missed you. 😭”*).\n- **🏠 Home Survival Dashboard**: Features the dynamic **🎓 Survival Score (0–100)**, shuffleable **Daily Student Quotes**, and quick-overview cards for Attendance, Assignments, Canteen, Timetable, and Next Exam.\n- **📊 75% Attendance Calculator**: Calculates both **Safe Bunk Allowance** and **Shortage Recovery Classes** using exact formulas, complete with quick `+1 Present 🟢` / `+1 Absent 🔴` logging and a standalone simulator.\n- **📝 Assignment Countdown**: Core subjects pre-populated (**DBMS**, **DS**, **DSD**, **VAC**, **Java**, **COA**) with urgency countdown badges and celebratory chimes.\n- **🍔 Campus Canteen Hub**: Live **🟢 OPEN** / **🔴 CLOSED** status toggle, funny warning quotes, full student snack menu with prices, and a bunk bill calculator.\n- **📅 Weekly Timetable**: Monday through Saturday schedule with auto-highlighting of the current day.\n- **⏳ Real-Time Exam Countdown**: Live ticker counting down **Days : Hours : Minutes : Seconds** every single second.\n- **😂 “Should I Sleep or Study?” Survival AI**: Interactive diagnostic wizard analyzing sleep hours, syllabus pending, and brain exhaustion (*Zombie 🧟*, *Drowsy 🥱*, *Caffeinated ⚡*), with an emergency **20-Minute Power Nap Timer & Alarm**.\n- **📱 Mobile-First Bottom Navigation**: Smooth 1-touch navigation bar for mobile devices.\n- **💾 LocalStorage Persistence**: All your data, attendances, and tasks remain saved after refreshing.\n- **🔊 Web Audio API Synthesizer**: Pure code synthesized pops, victory chimes, and alarm bells without loading external audio files."}
